    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>MORE KITTIES</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040820/extras/e496e576ab87b77926c1635ccde2f5a8.avif?t=1721980874\" width=630 height=100 /></span><br><br>Hidden Cat Memories is an exciting 2D hidden object game with handcrafted graphics where you search for lost souls of kitties in a surreal, fantasy world. As you find each lost soul, it transforms into a normal kitty that you must discover again. Each encounter allows you to unlock and relive its favorite memory with its human in life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040820/extras/14e6df37ef78682089bcb67b733e619f.avif?t=1721980874\" width=630 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>   <strong> Unique Gameplay: </strong>Discover lost souls of kitties and help them remember their favorite memories.<br></li><li>   <strong> Handcrafted Graphics:</strong> Beautiful, intricate illustrations create a surreal and engaging environment.<br></li><li>   <strong> Interactive Elements: </strong>Interact with various objects to reveal hidden souls.<br></li><li>   <strong> Symbol Collections: </strong>Find and complete collections of mysterious symbols, adding an extra layer of intrigue to your journey.<br></li><li>   <strong> Immersive Experience: </strong>Enjoy a relaxing yet challenging game that combines hidden object mechanics in a narrative way.<br></li><li>   <strong> Auto-Save:</strong> Auto-save feature ensures players' progress is saved automatically, allowing uninterrupted play.<br></li><li>   <strong> Achievements: </strong> A range of achievements, including 9 hidden ones.<br></li><li>   <strong> Music: </strong> Relaxing and immersive soundtrack that perfectly matches the pace of the game.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040820/extras/e496e576ab87b77926c1635ccde2f5a8.avif?t=1721980874\" width=630 height=100 /></span><br><br>Hidden Cat Memories is an exciting 2D hidden object game with handcrafted graphics where you search for lost souls of kitties in a surreal, fantasy world. As you find each lost soul, it transforms into a normal kitty that you must discover again. Each encounter allows you to unlock and relive its favorite memory with its human in life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3040820/extras/14e6df37ef78682089bcb67b733e619f.avif?t=1721980874\" width=630 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>   <strong> Unique Gameplay: </strong>Discover lost souls of kitties and help them remember their favorite memories.<br></li><li>   <strong> Handcrafted Graphics:</strong> Beautiful, intricate illustrations create a surreal and engaging environment.<br></li><li>   <strong> Interactive Elements: </strong>Interact with various objects to reveal hidden souls.<br></li><li>   <strong> Symbol Collections: </strong>Find and complete collections of mysterious symbols, adding an extra layer of intrigue to your journey.<br></li><li>   <strong> Immersive Experience: </strong>Enjoy a relaxing yet challenging game that combines hidden object mechanics in a narrative way.<br></li><li>   <strong> Auto-Save:</strong> Auto-save feature ensures players' progress is saved automatically, allowing uninterrupted play.<br></li><li>   <strong> Achievements: </strong> A range of achievements, including 9 hidden ones.<br></li><li>   <strong> Music: </strong> Relaxing and immersive soundtrack that perfectly matches the pace of the game.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Explore a surreal handcrafted world in Hidden Cat Memories. Find lost souls of kitties and help them remember their favorite moments with their humans. Each discovery transforms the kitty and reveals its touching memory. Immerse yourself in this unique hidden object adventure.",
